      ],
      "source": "https://wvexplorer.com/travel/communities/cities-towns/chattaroy-west-virginia/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The history of Chattaroy was closely tied to the Norfolk and Western Railway and the surrounding coal companies.",
